# Projects: Prompts

Purpose:
  Shared formalized prompt registry. Contains prompts that have been
  analyzed, formalized, and approved for execution. This is NOT a
  project instance — it is a cross-project registry of reusable
  prompt templates and their associated skills.

  Formalized prompts are linked to project instances (e.g. vkard.az)
  but are stored here for reuse across multiple projects.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1 @INDEX.sdd
   2 @prompt-001/
   3 @prompt-002/

Rules:
  [PR1] Every formalized prompt MUST have a unique ID.
  [PR2] Every prompt MUST document expected skills, decisions, and tasks.
  [PR3] Prompts MUST be reviewed by human before execution.
  [PR4] Prompts MUST include best practice references.
  [PR5] Prompt state MUST be tracked: draft, review, approved, active, done.
  [PR6] This folder is a shared registry, NOT a project instance.
  [PR7] Prompts MAY reference any project instance (e.g. vkard.az).
  [PR8] Prompt migrations are handled by the active project's migration system.

Navigation:
  Prompt001: @prompt-001/prompt.md
  Prompt001Skill: @prompt-001/skill/SKILL-API-PAYMENT-L1.sdd
  Prompt002: @prompt-002/prompt.md
  Prompt002Skill: @prompt-002/skill/SKILL-SECURITY-AUTH-L2.sdd
  PromptEngine: @../prompts/INDEX.sdd
  PromptDocs: @../../vkard.az/docs/prompts/
  Migration: @../commands/sdd-migrate.sdd

Exclusions:
  This folder is EXCLUDED from:
    - Project instance rules (projects/<name>/)
    - Project migration scope (migrations run for vkard.az, not here)
    - Project state tracking (tasks, decisions, tokens belong to projects)

State: +
